														Before i got into the things that have made me leave the guild i want to thank someone who is a vitle part of this guild.  The person i am talking about is Lastrae.  If it wasnt for him we would have nowhere to post our oppinions and just say hi.  I respect Lastrae for all he has done and just is attitude ingame.  An example would be the other day when Lastrae was talking about his peronal life in guild chat and Drac said something i would have NEVER said in a million years and instead of crying to Ukari Lastrae shruged it off and said something i truely respect, he said: We are a family and should be able to say whats on our mind.  So with that said i would like to personaly thank Lastrae for his dedication to this guild and I respect him and look to him as my role model.<br />
<br />
    But today something really got me steamed, Zybar always when ever i get on says somthing to me or others in the guild makeing fun of 1. My Charicter chose, i know rangers arnt the greatest class in the game but i have taken a fancy to mine and am proud of the hard work i put into making this char the best i could      2. OH WELL GET OVER IT ZYBAR im not as lifeless as you to camp a stupid stone and then when others try and fail and give up on something they dont even need or want, just a cool item to have, to then rag on them everytime they log on about this stupid camp. 3. Big man, you can deal out the insults but when they are pointed tward you you quit the guild then run to Ukari crying about a JOKE DO YOU KNOW WHAT A JOKE IS.  and if you wanted me to stop then ask me dont retaliate by insuling me back and expect me to read your mind that you want me to stop. Then I GET IN TROUBLE because you cant take a joke that you sure like to dish out but cant take. Im not going to put up with your nooby crap anylonger or anyones for that matter<br />
<br />
    I will miss most of all my Friends such as, Lastrae, Draconiius, Richmond, Cebi, ect. And dont really want to go but with new COCKY BIG SHOTS crying eveytime something goes wrong i really dont want to be apart of that and i think i am going to go as a one wolf for a while to clear my head and maybe 1 day rejoin PotD with all of my friends and we cn make it about having fun again and not telling on someone for joking around. and usualy when people make fun of you in a famly type struckure it means that when push comes to shove that famly member will always have your back no matter what was said in  the past.<br />
<br />
P.S. I really think that all of you should thank Lastrae for his dedication to this guild and helping make what it is today. And if you ever need a something or just a friend to talk to i will always be here for you on either Garlin or Joobay, I WILL MISS YOU ALL!!!!  And Cya all hope you dont forget me! :P						</td>
